# Hackathon scope control

## MVP path (prioritize)

RPC passthrough → preflight + decoder → policy engine → approval MaxUint256 block → Chainlink adapter → audit log → OpsRisk dashboard → Base Sepolia registry proof → Vercel deploy.

## Stretch (only after MVP demos)

ERC-4337, Safe transaction queue, private routing, universal DeFi decoder, full simulation farm, multi-chain.

## Rules

- Prefer one vertical slice over horizontal partials
- Cut anything that does not support judge demo flows in `docs/` / `ORCHESTRATOR.md`
- Kit repo: infrastructure and docs only until official build start
- One commit per MVP module in the **app repo** when hacking
